yone</span></h2><p class="pantry--ui">As a subscriber, you have<!-- --> <strong>10<!-- --> gift recipes</strong> to give each month. Anyone can view them - even nonsubscribers.<!-- --> <a href="https://help.nytimes.com/205343148-Features/360060848652-Gift-Articles-for-New-York-Times-Subscribers" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="Menu_learnMoreLink__05CZL">Learn more.</a></p><div class="Menu_buttonContainer__6jeig"><a class="button_button__tgtQk button_primary__Hsbni" href="https://www.nytimes.com/subscription/cooking.html"><span class="button_buttonText__75JJj">Subscribe</span></a><button class="button_button__tgtQk button_default__wXRq7" type="button"><span class="button_buttonText__75JJj">Log In</span></button></div><form class="buttondialog_closeMenuForm__3kPn2"><button aria-label="Close menu" class="buttondialog_closeMenuButton__42wn1" formMethod="dialog"><svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M13.293 1.41 8.056 6.646 7.703 7l.353.354 5.237 5.236-.703.703-5.236-5.237L7 7.703l-.354.353-5.236 5.237-.703-.703 5.237-5.236L6.297 7l-.353-.354L.707 1.41 1.41.707l5.236 5.237.354.353.354-.353L12.59.707l.703.703Z" stroke="#222"></path></svg></button></form></dialog></div></li><li><div class="buttondialog_container__zx4HK"><button aria-label="Share Recipe" class="button_button__tgtQk button_default__wXRq7 button_iconButton__Lf4zv" type="button" data-testid="share-recipe-button"><svg width="23" height="16" viewBox="0 0 23 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1.79 17.31a.691.691 0 0 1-.25 0 .82.82 0 0 1-.56-1C2.79 8.76 6.92 4.78 12.79 5.07V1.89a1 1 0 0 1 .51-.81.89.89 0 0 1 1 .12l7.8 6.65a1 1 0 0 1 .31.68 1 1 0 0 1-.31.68l-7.8 6.6a.92.92 0 0 1-.94.13.88.88 0 0 1-.52-.81v-3.41c-7.66-.75-10 4.83-10.15 5.07a.83.83 0 0 1-.9.52Zm9.59-7.3c.746.002 1.491.055 2.23.16a1 1 0 0 1 .78.88v2.44l5.86-5-5.86-5v2.4a.88.88 0 0 1-1 .88c-4.2-.47-7.38 1.48-9.36 5.66a11.44 11.44 0 0 1 7.35-2.42Z" fill="#222"></path></svg><