sage__yMhe_"><div class="popover_popover-body__aWR9h popover_popover-body--message__fjyF9"><div><p class="pantry--ui"><button class="button_button__tgtQk button_unstyled__DbQ5k popover_popover--logged-out-action__FUUmm" type="button"><span class="button_buttonText__75JJj">Log in</span></button> <!-- -->or<!-- --> <button class="button_button__tgtQk button_unstyled__DbQ5k popover_popover--logged-out-action__FUUmm" type="button"><span class="button_buttonText__75JJj">sign up</span></button> <!-- -->to rate this recipe.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ratingssection_subsection__56YJj"><div class="pantry--ui-strong ratingssection_subsectionLabel__Ym66Y">Have you cooked this?</div><div><div class="popover_popover-container__huJIK"><button class="button_button__tgtQk button_unstyled__DbQ5k markcookedbutton_markCookedButton__GICGD" type="button" aria-checked="false" role="checkbox"><svg width="29" height="30" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="markcookedbutton_cookedIcon__Ij1Vw"><path data-path-id="circle" d="M14.333 28.313c7.364 0 13.334-5.97 13.334-13.333 0-7.364-5.97-13.334-13.334-13.334C6.97 1.646 1 7.616 1 14.98s5.97 13.333 13.333 13.333Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></path><path data-path-id="check" d="m20.63 11.36-8.25 8.25-4.69-4.739" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="square"></path></svg><span class="button_buttonText__75JJj">Mark as Cooked</span></button><div style="opacity:0" class="popover_popover__Yn69l popover_position-bottom___YMPK popover_popover--logged-out-message__yMhe_"><div class="popover_popover-body__aWR9h popover_popover-body--message__fjyF9"><div><p class="pantry--ui"><button class="button_button__tgtQk button_unstyled__DbQ5k popover_popover--logged-out-action__FUUmm" type="button"><span class="button_buttonText__75JJj">Log in</span></button> <!-- -->or<!-- --> <button class="button_button__tgtQk button_unstyled__DbQ5k popover_popover--logged-out-action__FUUmm" type="button"><span class="button_buttonText__75JJj">sign up</span></button> <!-- -->to mark this recipe as cooked.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="notessection_notesSection__LKXhE" id="notes_section"><h2 class="pantry--title-section-alternate sectionheader_title__5aon0">Comments</h2><div class="notestabs_notesTabsWrapper__b0djM"><ul class="notestabs_notesTabs__eOuP0 notestabs_notesTabsWhenFormHidden__eT5Ao" role="tablist"><li role="presentation"><button class="button_button__tgtQk button_unstyled__DbQ5k" type="button" role="tab" id="all" aria-selected="false"><span class="button_buttonText__75JJj"><span class="pantry--ui-strong">All Comments</span></span></button></li></ul></div><section role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="helpful" class=""><div class="note_note__vjhlc"><header class="note_noteHeader__illrc"><div class="note_noteMetadata__0yk9F"><span class="pantry--ui-strong note_noteOwner__6bK1r"><span class="note_displaySpace__ekDvv">Laura</span></span><time class="pantry--ui-sm note_noteTime__yIrp_">4 years ago</time></div></header><div class="note_noteBody__7UXUQ"><p class="pantry--ui">Suggest that the baking time with cookies this large is going to be more like 19-20 minutes for me.

Love the tip about banging the tray on the counter.  That is a boss move and I did it.  

The recipe really isn’t that salty, so the flaky salt on top is definitely welcome.

And the verdict:  these are great cookies!  Love the chocolate to cookie ratio, and the cinnamon and brown sugar in the background just elevate the toastiness of the brown butter.  Where has this been all my life?</p><div class="noteactions_noteActions__VlyP0"><button class="button_button__tgtQk button_unstyled__DbQ5k noteactions_linkAppearance__DQAM2" type="button"><span class="button_buttonText__75JJj"><span class="pantry--ui noteactions_fontOverride__Hja9d">Is this helpful?</span><span class="noteactions_recommendationsCount__pdQnY"><svg width="18" height="13" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="noteactions_thumbsUpIcon__48HYT"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.816.694c-.478 0-.698.284-.698.284s.049 1.822.049 2.244c0 .421-2.089 3.79-2.6 4.222-.51.434-1.778 1.173-1.778 1.173-1.514 3.645.347 5.126.347 5.126h.978c.364 0 .814.56 1.307.56h6.39c1.528 0 2.052-1.945.525-1.945 1.528 0 2.054-1.943.526-1.943 1.529 0 2.053-1.947.524-1.947 1.529 0 2.053-1.944.524-1.944h-5.154c.187-.74.53-3.104.53-3.104-.076-1.144-.845-2.586-.845-2.586a1.608 1.608 0 0 0-.625-.14Zm0 .26c.135 0 .283.028.44.085.156.314.7 1.453.771 2.373-.039.268-.352 2.374-.521 3.05l-.081.32h5.486c.23 0 .412.052.524.152a.413.413 0 0 1 .134.321c0 .39-.42.955-1.183.955v.515c.232 0 .413.054.524.154a.406.406 0 0 1 .133.32c0 .392-.421.956-1.18.956v.517c.23 0 .41.053.523.151a.413.413 0 0 1 .133.32c0 .393-.421.958-1.183.958v.516c.231 0 .413.051.525.15a.406.406 0 0 1 .133.32c0 .394-.422.959-1.184.959H7.42c-.19 0-.405-.14-.612-.272-.23-.15-.45-.291-.694-.291h-.879c-.296-.292-1.457-1.684-.24-4.688.286-.169 1.286-.768 1.74-1.153.53-.45 2.688-3.886 2.688-4.42 0-.363-.034-1.727-.045-2.137a.72.72 0 0 1 .438-.131Z" fill="#fff"></path><mask id="thumbs-up_svg__a" style="mask-type:alpha" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="0" y="0" width="18" height="15"><path d="M.262 0h17.261v14.997H.262" fill="#fff"></path></mask><g mask="url(#thumbs-up_svg__a)"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.8