8tBR6"><section class="footer_footerLinksSection___Bf5n"><h3 class="pantry--ui-strong footer_subHeading__QxkiK">Learn More</h3><ul><li class="pantry--ui"><a class="link_link__7WCQy link_default__lKxiG footer_footerLink__yQaGV" href="/about-us">About Us</a></li><li class="pantry--ui"><a class="link_link__7WCQy link_default__lKxiG footer_footerLink__yQaGV" href="/article">Articles</a></li><li class="pantry--ui"><a class="link_link__7WCQy link_default__lKxiG footer_footerLink__yQaGV" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://help.nytimes.com/360011047512-New-York-Times-Cooking">FAQ</a></li><li class="pantry--ui"><a class="link_link__7WCQy link_default__lKxiG footer_footerLink__yQaGV" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.nytimes.com/section/food">NYTimes.com/food</a></li></ul></section><div class="footer_footerLinksSection___Bf5n"><h3 class="pantry--ui-strong footer_subHeading__QxkiK">Shop</h3><ul><li class="pantry--ui"><a class="link_link__7WCQy link_default__lKxiG footer_footerLink__yQaGV" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.nytimes.com/subscription/cooking/gift.html?campaignId=7HYRF">Gift Subscription</a></li><li class="pantry--ui"><a class="link_link__7WCQy link_default__lKxiG footer_footerLink__yQaGV" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://store.nytimes.com/collections/cooking-collection?utm_source=nyt_cooking&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=cooking_collection&amp;utm_content=footer">Merchandise</a></li><li class="pantry--ui"><a class="link_link__7WCQy link_default__lKxiG footer_footerLink__yQaGV footer_sendFeedback__aAeA_" href="mailto:cookingcare@nytimes.com" id="customer-care-email">Send Us Feedback</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="footer_recipeLinksSection__id8gC"><section class="footer_footerLinksSection___Bf5n"><h3 class="pantry--ui-strong footer_subHeading__QxkiK">Recipes</h3><ul><li class="pantry--ui"><a class="link_link__7WCQy link_default__lKxiG footer_footerLink__y